    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 6,
    "title": "Then, or alternatively",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk5-sequence-choice-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Then, or alternatively",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "In formal narration, the sequence word links a subsequent action. Paired alternative connectors offer choices rather than saying both occur.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他看了名字，便把书拿走了。",
                "pinyin": "tā kàn le míngzi ， biàn bǎ shū ná zǒu le 。",
                "meaning": "He read the name and then took the book away.",
                "audio": "54d1710a9363ae08cb9efc300102a67cd4ed160e800ad7276747c6b60d1becc6"
              },
              {
                "text": "或是今天去，或是明天去。",
                "pinyin": "huòshì jīntiān qù ， huòshì míngtiān qù 。",
                "meaning": "Either go today or go tomorrow.",
                "audio": "079bd970ceb25168d35aa1573d62b62bb88be8fd65d582f0bc41e08649c7c878"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "便",
                "pinyin": "biàn",
                "meaning": "then; as a result",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "a254fa87ea579ab6bd73b092470d4a5660df727a98ec55f6ffbe82211b795251"
              },
              {
                "text": "或是",
